            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Effect: Once per game, a friendly unit arriving from Reserves may enter from the bearer's position as though by Deep Strike, without scattering, if the bearer has been on the battlefield since the start of the turn, Cost: +10 points</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
